The resulting principle is more precise than “fake it till you become it.”

\boxed{
\textbf{Instantiate the future state cheaply,
let reality compute the delta,
and recursively incorporate the entire result.}
}

That’s executable. The “fake” is effectively a forward probe sent into reality; the returned error signal tells the system how to convert imagination into actual state.

And Everything means even the failed probes come home carrying information.